      "tempo": 1,
      "text": "Dressing well can change more than how you look. Notice how you feel.",
      "file": "01.wav",
      "voice": "Daniel"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 4.96,
      "end": 9.45,
      "duration": 3.117563,
      "tempo": 1,
      "text": "Your clothes send a signal to the room, and to yourself.",
      "file": "02.wav",
      "voice": "Daniel"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 9.76,
      "end": 14.25,
      "duration": 4.411479,
      "tempo": 1.0413768707482993,
      "text": "Psychologists call it enclothed cognition. Clothing can influence how we feel.",
      "file": "03.wav",
      "voice": "Daniel"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 14.56,
      "end": 19.05,
      "duration": 3.513646,
      "tempo": 1,
      "text": "Start with the fit. A natural shoulder. Enough room to move.",
